  "lineage": "Solo song of the Gbaya of western Central African Republic that Vincent Dehoux studied as 'thinking songs' (chants à penser): a singer accompanies reflective verses on a sanza lamellophone, often sung alone, for the singer himself. The Congolese lukembi card stands in for the Gbaya sanza.",
